{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Gentle, focused private sessions</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Short-form intensives and ongoing consultation for adults. Confidential, practical, and tailored to your life in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css" />
</head>
<body class="aura">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="logo" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="/about.html">Begin</a>
        <a href="/specialties.html">What I Do</a>
        <a href="/fees.html">Ways & Fees</a>
        <a href="/approach.html">Approach</a>
        <a href="/faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="/book.html" class="cta">Book a Session</a>
        <a href="/contact.html" class="muted">Connect</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="try-btn" id="open-exercise">Try it now</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" style="background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1 class="headline">Thoughtful, time-honored clinical care for life in motion</h1>
        <p class="lede">I offer short intensives and ongoing options for adults seeking private, confidential support. Sessions blend problem-solving and somatic awareness so practical decisions feel possible again.</p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <button id="open-exercise-hero" class="secondary">Try a short exercise</button>
        </div>
        <p class="contact">Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">email</a> to ask about availability in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="diagnostic reveal" id="diagnostic">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Short diagnostic and focus setting</h2>
        <p class="muted">Our first meetings are designed to quickly clarify the decision or pattern you want attention on, and to craft a small number of actionable next steps. The aim is clarity over complexity—figuring what is most useful next.</p>
        <ul class="bullets">
          <li>30-minute orientation to map your priorities</li>
          <li>Collaborative goals that fit your values and schedule</li>
          <li>Clearly scoped next steps you can try between meetings</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plan reveal" id="plan">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Programs & ways of working</h2>
        <p class="muted">I offer two primary formats — brief, concentrated options for focused concerns, and a paced series for people seeking steadier companionship through transitions.</p>
        <div class="plans">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Compass Intensive</h3>
            <p class="small">A short, structured sequence for a clear decision or immediate pattern to shift.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>3 sessions across 3–6 weeks</li>
              <li>Focused behavioral experiments and tailored reflections</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="price">From $480</div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Seasonal Series</h3>
            <p class="small">5 sessions, paced to support transitions and habit changes with accountability and refinement.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Flexible scheduling—weekly or biweekly</li>
              <li>Tools for routine, self-checks, and relational shifts</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="price">From $760</div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Single session</h3>
            <p class="small">One thoughtful hour when you need focused reflection and immediate next steps.</p>
            <div class="price">$150</div>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="disclaimer">These are examples of common pathways; we’ll adapt any plan to your needs. Sessions follow confidential, ethical practice. If you are in crisis or danger, please contact emergency services or local crisis lines — I am not an emergency service.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="micro_habits reveal" id="micro_habits">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Small practices that change momentum</h2>
        <p class="muted">Micro-practices grounded in attention and routine help translate insight into steady change. You’ll receive simple, evidence-informed suggestions you can try between sessions.</p>
        <div class="habits">
          <div class="habit">3-minute breathing check-ins</div>
          <div class="habit">Nightly journaling prompts</div>
          <div class="habit">Weekly values review</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing reveal" id="pricing">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ways to pay & what to expect</h2>
        <p class="muted">I accept private pay and provide receipts suitable for out-of-network reimbursement. Fees are transparent and discussed before scheduling.</p>
        <table class="fee-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Service</th><th>Length</th><th>Typical fee</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Single session</td><td>50–60 min</td><td>$150</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Compass Intensive (package)</td><td>3 sessions</td><td>From $480</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Seasonal Series</td><td>5 sessions</td><td>From $760</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="muted">If finances are a barrier, we can discuss limited sliding scale availability or referrals. No one is obliged to continue beyond the agreed plan.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta reveal" id="final-cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ready to begin?</h2>
        <p class="muted">If you want a short conversation to see if we’re a fit, you can call or email, or request a booking online.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="ghost" href="/contact.html">Send a note</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="columns">
        <div>
          <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
          <p class="small muted">Private practice therapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Confidential clinical services — notes are kept in a secure practice record and shared only with your consent, except as required by law.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="small">Scope & limits: I provide psychotherapy and clinical consultation for adults. I do not provide emergency services. If you are at risk, call local emergency services or your regional crisis line.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-info">
          <p class="small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
          <p class="small">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mini">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • All clinical material is confidential and governed by professional practice standards.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Guided exercise modal -->
  <div id="exercise-modal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="modal-panel">
      <button class="modal-close" id="close-exercise" aria-label="Close">✕</button>
      <h3 id="exercise-title">Try a short practice</h3>
      <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
        <button class="tab active" data-mode="breath">Breathing</button>
        <button class="tab" data-mode="journaling">Journaling</button>
        <button class="tab" data-mode="intention">Intention</button>
      </div>

      <div class="exercise" id="exercise-content">
        <!-- breathing content -->
        <div class="mode mode-breath" data-mode="breath">
          <p class="muted">A paced 2-minute breathing anchor. Follow the circle and the prompts.</p>
          <div class="breath-circle" id="breath-circle" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="breath-controls">
            <label>Duration: <select id="breath-duration"><option value="60">1 min</option><option value="120" selected>2 min</option><option value="180">3 min</option></select></label>
            <button id="start-breath">Start</button>
            <button id="stop-breath" disabled>Stop</button>
          </div>
          <p class="breath-text" id="breath-text">Ready.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- journaling content -->
        <div class="mode mode-journaling" data-mode="journaling" hidden>
          <p class="muted">A brief prompt to notice what feels most present. Write for 5–10 minutes if you can.</p>
          <label for="journal-input">Prompt: What is one small thing you noticed today that matters?</label>
          <textarea id="journal-input" rows="6" placeholder="Write freely — this is private to your browser unless you choose to save."></textarea>
          <div class="journal-actions">
            <button id="save-journal">Save locally</button>
            <button id="clear-journal">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <p class="muted small">Saved entries stay in this browser only. Clearing removes them.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- intention content -->
        <div class="mode mode-intention" data-mode="intention" hidden>
          <p class="muted">Set a simple intention you can revisit. Keep it specific and compassionate.</p>
          <input id="intention-input" placeholder="I intend to..." />
          <div class="intent-actions">
            <button id="save-intent">Set intention</button>
            <button id="clear-intent">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <p class="small muted" id="current-intent">No intention set.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
"}
